<title>USA: Great Western sets $300 mln capital securities.</title>
<headline>Great Western sets $300 mln capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of capital securities, a trust preferred issue, was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER GREAT WESTERN FINANCIAL TRUST II</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 8.206 PCT  MATURITY 02/01/2027</p>
<p>TYPE CAP SECS	ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD  8.206 PCT  PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 135 BP     CALLABLE AFTER 10 YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
